            <ArticleTitle>[Digital CT scanogram versus conventional general image in the diagnosis of ileus--a prospective study].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>355-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>CT-Sonogram as an independent examination should be used in defined cases of ileus combined with pregnancy, obesity, great abdominal tumours (e.g. large hernias). Less x-ray exposure and absence of faulty x-ray films are the arguments in favour of this method.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
